   "verbatim_snippet": "Commissioners adopted a ban on data centers on April 20, replacing a temporary moratorium with a prohibition in the county zoning ordinance. (servercountry.org) / giant.fm: the permanent ban 'takes effect immediately, replacing a one-year moratorium the county previously had in place.' Companion BESS ordinance requires 'a strict 1,320-foot (a quarter-mile) setback from the nearest adjoining property line.'",
