   "raw_row": "{\"county\": \"Clay\", \"jurisdiction\": \"Clay County\", \"action_type\": \"proposed\", \"instrument\": \"Commissioner floor discussion / possible ballot referendum on zoning authority\", \"posture_source_words\": \"without zoning laws, the county cannot issue a moratorium or pause any development related to data centers\", \"observed_date\": \"2026-07-07\", \"date_note\": \"Two WTHI articles (dated 2026-07-07 and 2026-07-09 per their URLs) cover back-to-back meetings; earlier date used. wthitv.com's robots.txt disallows ClaudeBot/Claude-Web, so this is drawn only from the search engine's indexed snippet, not a direct fetch of the article.\", \"effective_from\": null, \"effective_to\": null, \"verbatim_snippet\": \"We as commissioners don't want to make that decision for zoning when we have as many people telling us they don't want it as much as there are telling us they do want it.\", \"url\": \"https://www.wthitv.com/2026/07/07/clay-county-officials-public-raise-concerns-about-potential-data-center-during-back-to-back-meetings/\", \"doc_type\": \"news article\", \"evidence_grade\": \"REPORTED_NEEDS_VERIFICATION\", \"why_codified_misses_it\": \"A commissioner floor discussion about lacking zoning-based authority, and mulling a referendum, produces no zoning-code text at all, before or after.\", \"pulled_at\": \"2026-08-16T00:00:00Z\"}"
