   "date_note": "MSN/Yahoo syndication reports a 2-1 vote (Commissioner Compere dissenting) but no dateline was visible in the retrieved text, and the county's own site (claycountyin.gov) refused connection on repeated attempts. WFYI's 2026-07-06 roundup does not yet list Clay as having a moratorium, and the 2026-07-09 WTHI report says the county still lacked a mechanism to enact one, so this vote likely falls between mid-July and mid-August 2026 — not confirmed further. Duration is stated as '1-year' but no explicit start/end date was found; not invented.",
   "effective_from": null,
   "effective_to": null,
